umiproc patch 0009: shift the loaded map's keyframe times only on the first relocalization

What: Tracking::Track, INIT_RELOCALIZE: the time shift that puts the map's last keyframe one frame period before
the relocalized frame is applied only the first time (a Tracking flag); later relocalizations leave every
keyframe time as it is.
Why: on every relocalization the fork shifted all keyframes of the map, the run's own included, so that the last
one sat just before the new keyframe. After the first one this moves the run's keyframes away from their frames
(the CSV's is_keyframe stops matching; the map's first keyframe went -6.40 -> -13.08 -> -23.82 s over three
relocalizations) and inflates the time between the last keyframe and the new one, which LocalMapping adds to
mTinit (VIBA 1 at 5 s, VIBA 2 at 15 s, scale refinements at 25, 35, ... s): VIBA 2 ran inside a 12 s demo.
Behaviour change: localization runs that relocalize more than once.
Exported with 1 line of context, so that it and patch 0001 do not overlap.

diff --git a/include/Tracking.h b/include/Tracking.h
index 6a7ce8f..ee07c61 100644
--- a/include/Tracking.h
+++ b/include/Tracking.h
@@ -316,2 +316,3 @@ protected:
     bool mbLoadedMap;
+    bool mbMapTimesShifted = false;   // umiproc patch 0009: the loaded map's keyframe times were shifted once
 
diff --git a/src/Tracking.cc b/src/Tracking.cc
index 4c2ded1..fa6eeff 100644
--- a/src/Tracking.cc
+++ b/src/Tracking.cc
@@ -1704,2 +1704,9 @@ void Tracking::Track()
                         double t_offset = - vpKFs.back()->mTimeStamp - dt;
+                        // umiproc patch 0009: shift only on the first relocalization, when the keyframes are all the
+                        // loaded map's (so the demo starts right after it in time). Later ones shifted every keyframe,
+                        // the run's own too, again: their times drifted (is_keyframe in the CSV, KF culling) and the
+                        // gap to the new keyframe was inflated (LocalMapping's mTinit, which triggers VIBA 1/2 and the
+                        // scale refinements).
+                        if (mbMapTimesShifted)
+                            t_offset = 0.0;
                         for (auto kf : vpKFs) {
@@ -1707,2 +1714,3 @@ void Tracking::Track()
                         }
+                        mbMapTimesShifted = true;
 
